OL,3,ACarney calls Trump's fresh tariffs a
OL,4,A'miscalculation' after trade talks
OL,5,Acollapse
OL,6,
OL,7,FCanada's Prime Minister Mark Carney has
OL,8,Fsaid a fresh wave of US tariffs on
OL,9,FCanada is a "miscalculation" designed
OL,10,Fto "hurt and divide us", after trade
OL,11,Ftalks broke down late on Friday.
OL,13,FCarney said he walked away from a deal
OL,14,Fbecause he was not prepared to
OL,15,F"compromise Canada's sovereignty".
OL,17,F"They asked too much and they offered
OL,18,Ftoo little," Carney said in a speech to
OL,19,FCanadians on Saturday morning.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
