OL,3,ACarney calls Trump's fresh tariffs a
OL,4,A'miscalculation' after trade talks
OL,5,Acollapse
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe prime minister added that Canada
OL,8,Fwill match US tariffs
OL,9,F"dollar-for-dollar" from 8 September,
OL,10,Fincluding levies on steel, dairy,
OL,11,Fappliances and electronics. Donald
OL,12,FTrump has yet to comment.
